<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells platinum to Johnson Matthey.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells platinum to Johnson Matthey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 10,188 troy ounces of platinum to Johnson Matthey for $3,763,243.</p>
<p>This concluded the sale of platinum in the current fiscal year which ends September 30.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
